e a majority with mr  macron's party  it's a very big surprise because the  republicans did very badly  in the presidential election only two  months ago and they come out as a king  maker of the political situation in  france  in 2017 macross party won a  parliamentary majority in a landslide  that enabled the president to push  through often controversial reforms at  times in the face of street protests his  second term is already shaping up to be  very different and so is the parliament  more fragmented than ever but perhaps a  more accurate reflection of france's  political landscape  natasha butler al jazeera paris
 

